%N A399453 Total number of matchings in all labeled trees on n vertices.
%H A399453 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A399453/b399453.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..300</a>
%H A399453 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/IndependentEdgeSet.html">Independent Edge Set</a>.
%o A399453 (PARI) seq(n)={my(u=v=O(x)); for(n=1, n, my(t=x*exp(u+v)); v=u*t; u=t); Vec(serlaplace(intformal((u + v)/x)))}
